---
import { css } from 'styled-system/css';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const h2 = css({ fontSize: 'xl', fontWeight: 'semibold', mt: '2' });
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="What this site stores and what it does not.">
  <h1 class={css({ fontSize: '3xl', fontWeight: 'bold' })}>Privacy</h1>
  <!-- verify-dist.mjs refuses to build a launched site while this attribute is present. -->
  <p data-starter-placeholder>Starter text. Review and replace it before launch.</p>

  <h2 class={h2}>What is stored on your device</h2>
  <p>
    The category filters you choose on the home page are saved in your browser's local storage so
    they are still set when you come back. Nothing else is stored. To remove it, use "Reset
    filters" on the home page or clear this site's data in your browser.
  </p>

  <h2 class={h2}>What is sent anywhere</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing. The site's code never transmits what it stores. There are no cookies, no analytics
    and no tracking.
  </p>

  <h2 class={h2}>The host</h2>
  <p>
    The site is served by Cloudflare. Like any web host, Cloudflare processes standard request
    data, such as IP addresses, in order to deliver each page.
  </p>
</Base>
